Notes
Modalities:
● I = RGB image
● V = Video
● T = Text
● L = LiDAR
● M = HD map
● Tra. = Trajectory
Data Sources:
● Real = Real-world data
● Sim = Simulation data
QA Tasks:
● VQA = Visual Question Answering
● CQA = Counterfactual Question Answering
● Caption = Scene/Image Captioning
● Reasoning = Causal, spatial, or temporal reasoning
● SU = Spatial Understanding
● QA = General Question Answering
● P1 = Perception-level QA
● P2 = Prediction-focused QA
● P3 = Planning and behavior QA
● GVQA = Graph-based Visual Question Answering
Dataset Statistics:
● MCQ = Multiple-choice Questions
● Evaluation QA = QA pairs used for evaluation
● Training QA = QA pairs used for training
Links and Availability:
● Paper titles link to the corresponding publications when verified.
● Resources link to official project repositories or dataset websites when available.
● A dash (—) indicates that a verified public resource link has not yet been added. It does not necessarily mean that the dataset is unavailable.
